<ui-nav title="连线测试" />
<view class="task-page ai-copilot-safe-space"><view class="task-content">
  <view class="task-heading"><text class="task-kicker">视觉搜索与认知转换</text><text class="task-title">连线测试</text><text class="task-subtitle">先完成数字顺序，再完成数字与字母交替</text></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:if="{{phase === 'intro' || phase === 'paused'}}"><text class="section-title">测试说明</text><text class="instruction">A 阶段按 1、2、3…依次点击；B 阶段按 1、A、2、B…交替点击。点错后继续寻找当前正确目标。</text><view class="notice">节点位置每次保持固定且互不遮挡，系统记录用时、错误和纠正过程。</view><text wx:if="{{phase === 'paused'}}" class="paused-text">本阶段已中断，请重新开始整项测试</text><button class="primary-button" bindtap="startTest">开始测试</button></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:elif="{{phase === 'testing'}}"><view class="progress-row"><text>{{stageTitle}}</text><text>错误 {{errors}}</text></view><view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-value" style="{{'width:' + progressPercent + '%;'}}"></view></view><view class="trail-board"><view wx:for="{{nodes}}" wx:key="id" class="trail-node {{item.order < currentIndex ? 'trail-node--done' : ''}}" style="{{'left:' + item.x + '%;top:' + item.y + '%;'}}" data-label="{{item.label}}" aria-role="button" aria-label="节点 {{item.label}}" bindtap="handleNodeTap">{{item.label}}</view></view></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:elif="{{phase === 'rest'}}"><text class="section-title">A 阶段完成</text><text class="instruction">本阶段用时 {{elapsedText}}。休息片刻后开始需要交替转换规则的 B 阶段。</text><button class="primary-button" bindtap="continuePartB">开始 B 阶段</button></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:elif="{{phase === 'result'}}"><text class="section-title">结果摘要</text><view class="result-grid"><view class="result-stat"><text class="result-value">{{result.elapsed_ms}} ms</text><text class="result-label">总用时</text></view><view class="result-stat"><text class="result-value">{{result.errors}}</text><text class="result-label">错误次数</text></view></view><text class="sync-status">{{syncStatus}}</text><button wx:if="{{syncStatus === '待同步'}}" class="primary-button" bindtap="retrySync">重新同步</button><button wx:if="{{mode === 'battery'}}" class="secondary-button" bindtap="goNext">继续完整评估</button><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="startTest">重新测试</button></view>
  <text class="medical-tip">本测试仅记录客观执行表现，不替代专业医生诊断</text>
</view></view>
